    // We tile r and s to improve cache locality, and split t to
    // operate on chunks of the reduction dimension that fit in cache.
    //
    // Layout recap:
    //  - Buffers are indexed as (x, y) == (column, row).
    //  - s is the x-dimension (columns, contiguous in memory).
    //  - r is the y-dimension (rows).
